    {
      "speaker": "staff",
      "start": 11.623,
      "end": 12.024,
      "text": "Yes, we do.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "caller",
      "start": 13.443,
      "end": 17.904,
      "text": "is there any way I can get the chips on the side? Cause I kinda drive a distance.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "staff",
      "start": 18.665,
      "end": 28.088,
      "text": "Sure. Yeah, yeah, well, whatever, like the meat, we usually, what we do is we put the meat, the toppings, inside the container, and then your chips will be on the little bag.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "caller",
      "start": 29.106,
      "end": 31.546,
      "text": "Okay, that'll work. Can I get an order of those?",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "staff",
      "start": 32.65,
      "end": 34.11,
      "text": "And nachos, chorizo, you said?",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "caller",
      "start": 35.127,
      "end": 35.307,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "staff",
      "start": 36.851,
      "end": 41.732,
      "text": "Did you want beans, lettuce, pico de gallo, sour cream? Cheese and queso dip.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "caller",
      "start": 43.449,
      "end": 44.729,
      "text": "Yeah, all of that is fine.",
      "language": "en"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "staff",
      "start": 44.253,
      "end": 44.473,
      "text": "Okay.",
